    "conventions": [
      "Each record should include numeric 'id', 'start_id', 'end_id', and 'type' (relationship verb).",
      "Alternatively, use 'start_slug' and 'end_slug' to refer to nodes by slug when numeric ids are unknown or to make the file human-editable; ingestion will MERGE by slug if supported.",
      "Use 'description' for a short human summary; carry structured evidence fields (evidence_url, citation_style, page_refs, source_note) when available.",
      "When the same evidence is reused across multiple edges, prefer an ':Evidence' node and link to it.",
      "Status values: PROPOSED | REVIEWED | APPROVED. Ingest will set provenance fields on import if missing."
    ]
